## Why This Is Asked
This question evaluates practical end-to-end testing expertise for streaming analytics systems with strict SLAs, deterministic replay requirements, and tenant isolation. It tests understanding of the complete pipeline from ingestion through processing to UI validation under various failure conditions.

## Key Concepts
- Streaming data ingestion and windowed aggregate computations
- End-to-end latency management under backpressure conditions
- Deterministic event replay and idempotent processing
- Multi-tenant isolation and controlled data seeding

## Code Example
```javascript
// Test setup with Testcontainers
const kafka = new KafkaContainer().withExposedPorts(9093);
const testTopics = ['tenant-1-trades', 'tenant-2-trades'];

// Deterministic data seeding
